{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15d0_level_act15d0_08_beg","groupId":"act15d0","stageId":"act15d0_08","title":"激戰之末","storyCode":"MB-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"da829a559f75724c97e8da41a5ea5ea2f91883a02f0bbf47a388f9f8a3493af1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在停屍間，傑斯頓等候多時。他挾持了杜瑪威脅安東尼，並要求羅賓做出選擇。而羅賓選擇了安東尼。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Morgue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你們真是搞出了不小的動靜啊，安東尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我事先沒有知道你們的計畫，恐怕我也攔不住你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是傑斯頓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，正是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然在這座監獄中有過數次擦肩而過，不過請容許我重新自我介紹一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫做傑斯頓·威廉姆斯，是你這次越獄行動中最後的阻礙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"杜瑪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"她在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼，對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"我在醫務室等你，沒想到這個人忽然帶著一些囚犯進來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"杜瑪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"如此陰森的地方，怎麼能讓這樣一位美麗的小姐孤單地在這裡等待呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我就稍微保護了一下她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，羅賓小姐，你似乎失敗了，真是令人遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你根本沒有執行刺殺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"她失敗了，你的手下傷不了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"但你卻留了她一命，我不得不說，你真是一名出色的紳士，安東尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話少說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，那就讓我們直奔主題吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼先生，不想這位小姐死去的話，請過來這邊一點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"卡夫卡小姐，請你乖乖地站在那裡不要動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎十分擅長渾水摸魚，希望你不要擅自做一些會傷到杜瑪小姐的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"對，就站在那裡就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，圍住他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼，你別聽他的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"不要說話，杜瑪，我會救你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"危急關頭還能保持冷靜，真是令人敬佩，安東尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該知道我想要幹什麼，你也知道我不可能會忽然動了惻隱之心放過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我的建議是，你可以考慮拋棄這位小姐，拋棄你一直以來偽裝自己的教養，然後來與我廝殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話，少說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你能堅持到什麼時候呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"然後是你，羅賓小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"誒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，請你殺了安東尼先生，完成你未竟的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不在乎你在剛才與安東尼先生達成了怎樣的協定，又發生了怎樣的心境轉變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想獲得那筆錢，如果你想救你的父親，那麼，這是你最後，也是最好的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你在猶豫什麼？是安東尼對你許諾了什麼空頭支票？還是事到如今你心軟了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你唯一的機會了，羅賓小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"想想你的父親，想想你變得一團糟的生活，想想你的未來，想想你的願望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是你，我不會猶豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我想做的還不明顯嗎？如果我只是想殺害你，在監獄之中我有許多機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"但這些都太沒意思了，真的，太沒意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"殺人這件事對我來說並沒有特別的樂趣，安東尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說，最有趣的部分，是改變，是人面臨抉擇時不得不拋棄過去面孔的那一瞬間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我把羅賓小姐引來，渴望羅賓小姐的改變，渴望她的墮落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"也渴望你的改變，渴望你此時此刻為了你的家人，為了你的目的，而拋棄一直以來的矜持，露出你的獠牙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，別裝了，安東尼先生，說真的，別裝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"想想你的家族，想想你受的無妄之災，想想你的忍辱負重，想想你越獄的目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的甘心就這樣死在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的甘心為了區區一個認識幾年的女性就葬送性命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"站起來，安東尼先生，推開羅賓小姐，忘掉杜瑪小姐，撲向我，然後殺害我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"別把所有人都想得和你一樣，傑斯頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"別以為你與眾不同，安東尼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我給你五秒鐘時間，羅賓小姐，時間到的話，我就會親自動手，而你，恐怕也不得不葬身此地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"五。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"羅賓小姐，你父親的手術費還差許多，而安東尼先生現在身無分文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"四。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼先生，你的父母因為在監獄中受到排擠，過得非常不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......父親，母親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"三。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼，不要管我，你不能死在這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"哼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"臭女人，趁我不注意居然想自殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"羅......賓......不要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到杜瑪小姐比我想的還要剛烈，真是一位可敬的女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"真是可惜，事情沒有如她所願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"傑，斯，頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在的表情真棒，安東尼先生，真棒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好奇，是什麼讓你如此堅定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你認為你的死能換來我善待剩下的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"原則於你真的有這麼重要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你還留有後手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在這座監獄裡，做過許多違背我原則的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"對這群獄卒曲意逢迎，幫巴頓站台，打不想打的人，過不想過的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這與原則無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這與我有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我不願意為了自己的目的而犧牲杜瑪，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你的家人還在等著你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有資格評論我的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你還有要報的仇和搞清楚的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這些並不比一個朋友的生命重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"即使這會葬送你的性命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"即使這會葬送我的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你必須自己去思考每一件事，去做出每一個選擇，並為每一個選擇負責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"否則的話，你是無法主宰自己的命運的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你必須重新審視自己，去思考，你究竟想要做什麼事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Morgue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"真是遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，二。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅賓終於邁開了腳步。\n她緩緩走到安東尼身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"羅賓小姐，我理解你的掙扎，但你必須做出選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你做什麼選擇，都不要讓自己後悔，羅賓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅賓揮下手中的匕首。\n然而，匕首在半空中脫手而出。\n她的目標不是安東尼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囚犯A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼，杜瑪交給我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖！別想！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，我可憋好久了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼時候？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"吼！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你的後手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你斷定羅賓小姐會站在你這邊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，或許只是你開的條件還不夠誘人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣真的好嗎，羅賓小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你選擇了一條在我看來毫無未來的道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸變成今天那樣雖然確實是西蒙家一夜之間覆滅導致的，但是在那之後他的一蹶不振是他自己的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直是知道這一點的，我只是不願意去承認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"而我自己......也確實不想這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼向我許諾了他逃出去後也會幫我父親的醫藥費想辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"但其實這無所謂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經決定了不刺殺安東尼，即使安東尼不幫我，我也會想別的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"而如果因為我這麼做導致了來不及醫治爸爸的病，那我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"那我會自殺，去地下向他道歉，告訴他，是女兒沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"漂亮，實在是漂亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"真是令人感動的覺悟，羅賓小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是因為這樣的覺悟而選擇違背我們之間小小的協議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"那我不僅不想責怪你，甚至想要為你鼓掌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也必須要指出一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我所說的沒有未來，並不是你們“完成越獄”之後的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"而是現在，此時此地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你們沒有成功逃獄的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這就要試一試才知道了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_8_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不不不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我必須要承認，你的武力確實相當強大，安東尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而對我來說，不僅是殺人，暴力也不是什麼特別有意思的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以為了不讓你“試一試”，杜瑪小姐只是第一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第二步是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_8_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼，卡夫卡，你們沒事吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒......事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們該不會忘了自己身上還戴著枷鎖吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，這傢伙，準備得真是周全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你的讚美，卡夫卡小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙，從一開始就是在騙羅賓吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，我只是一向不會只做一手準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"羅賓小姐要是得手，那我樂得清閒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"而她要是失手，你看，我也為她準備了後手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能說我沒有為她著想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"說得好聽，明明是你把她捲進來的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我從未否認我的目的是想要目睹她的掙扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"但是卡夫卡小姐，你也是有自己事業的人，請好好想想，如果我沒有把她捲進來，她能找到方法籌齊她父親的醫藥費嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我認為可能性很低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你也無法反駁我，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......我不得不承認，羅賓......如果幫你......會更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，她沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這，就，夠，了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"吼！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"居然在這種情況下還能戰鬥嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"也罷，就讓我親自來撲滅你最後的一點幻想吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼，我來幫你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，我可沒有安東尼那樣的力氣啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......你們當心，他的手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"他的手，變黑了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，多麼溫情脈脈的一幕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"而一想到這一幕能由我親自來打碎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我就感到十分開心啊，安東尼老弟！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_214_kafka","aliases":["卡夫卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","aliases":["安東尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_441_lotus","aliases":["杜瑪"]},{"speakerId":"char_451_robin","aliases":["羅賓"]}]}
